cff-version: 1.2.0
title: DSCodex
message: If you mention or cite this software, use these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Su
    given-names: Silas
    alias: fish2lab
repository-code: "https://github.com/fish2lab/DSCodex"
url: "https://github.com/fish2lab/DSCodex"
license: MIT
version: 1.3.0
date-released: "2026-09-23"
abstract: >-
  Open-source local loopback router that adds DeepSeek V4.1 Flash to the
  stock ChatGPT desktop app, Codex CLI, and Codex IDE while keeping GPT
  models on ChatGPT OAuth, including the desktop Responses WebSocket.
  DeepSeek uses the native HTTP Responses API; GPT websocket upgrades are
  proxied to chatgpt.com. No fork and no app patch.
keywords:
  - DSCodex
  - DeepSeek
  - DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
  - Codex
  - ChatGPT
  - Responses API
  - WebSocket
  - reconnect
  - coding agent
  - loopback router
